hat interaction, there was incidental contact, and we regret that the situation escalated.''\par \par \uc2 The company added that the incident had not met the standard of professionalism it expected from its team, adding, ''We have addressed the matter internally to help ensure situations like this do not happen again.''\par \par \uc2 Taylor told TMZ after the ceremony that everyone was having a good time but ''security was just doing a lot.''\par \par \uc2 ''At the end of the day, I just don't tolerate disrespect,'' she said, ''especially when it's unwarranted and it's unprovoked.''\par \par \uc2 Document NYTF000020260319em3j0003m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw284\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal4260\pichgoal600
